Wrap Transformation"}, {"src": "/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/3-89.webp", "title": "Personal Chevy Van G20 Getaway (1989) – Full Custom Wrap", "tag": ""}], "eid": "4c9998b"}], "padding": "0px 0px 20px 0px", "maxWidth": null, "minHeight": null, "background": "#FFFFFF", "bgImage": null, "bgSize": null, "bgPosition": null, "bgRepeat": null}, {"id": "b45e69d", "blocks": [{"type": "columns", "cols": [{"width": 74.87, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "html": "<p>At Vinyl Wrap Toronto, we love taking on unique projects, and this one was particularly exciting! We had the opportunity to work on a Chevrolet Chevy Van G20 1989 Get Away Camper, transforming it with a custom color change wrap for a movie set. Whether it’s for personal use, business branding, or film production, our high-quality vinyl wraps ensure vehicles stand out in style.</p> <h3><strong>Why Choose a Color Change Wrap for a Classic Vehicle?</strong></h3> <p>Classic vehicles like the Chevy Van G20 1989 Get Away Camper have timeless appeal, but their original paint may fade over time. A color change wrap provides several advantages:</p> <ul> <li>Restores and enhances the vehicle’s aesthetic without the need for repainting</li> <li>Protects the original paint from wear and tear</li> <li>Fully customizable with a variety of color and finish options</li> <li>Easily removable, preserving the vehicle’s authenticity</li> <li>Ideal for movie sets, allowing seamless design changes for production needs</li> </ul> <h3><strong>Transforming the Chevy Van G20 for the Big Screen</strong></h3> <p>Our expert team at Vinyl Wrap Toronto followed a precise process to ensure a flawless color change wrap for this classic Chevy Van G20:</p> <ol> <li>Consultation &amp; Design Selection: The production team provided specifications for a period-correct yet vibrant design.</li> <li>Thorough Preparation: The van was cleaned and prepped to ensure maximum vinyl adhesion.</li> <li>Application of the Wrap: Our skilled installers applied the color change vinyl with precision to match the vision for the film.</li> <li>Final Inspection: We ensured a seamless, professional look suitable for high-definition filming.</li> </ol> <h3><strong>Why Choose Vinyl Wrap Toronto for Your Custom Wraps?</strong></h3> <p>Located in Etobicoke, Toronto, Vinyl Wrap Toronto specializes in color change wraps, custom vehicle branding, and movie set graphics. With experience working on classic cars, commercial fleets, and film industry projects, we deliver high-quality results using premium vinyl materials.</p> <h3><strong>Get Your Vehicle Wrapped Today!</strong></h3> <p>Whether you need a color change wrap for a classic car, a commercial vehicle wrap, or a custom film production wrap, we have you covered. Trust Vinyl Wrap Toronto to bring your vision to life with precision and expertise.</p> <p>📞 Call us: <a href=\"tel:416-746-1381\">416-746-1381</a><br/>📧 Email us: <a href=\"mailto:info@VinylWrapToronto.com\">info@VinylWrapToronto.com</a><br/>📍 Visit us: <a href=\"https://g.page/vinylwraptoronto?share\">24 Ronson Dr, Unit 1, Etobicoke ON M9W 1B4</a></p> <p></p>", "style": "text-align:start;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5em;font-weight:300", "eid": "85e4764"}, {"type": "postnav", "prev": {"href": "/metallic-wrap-mazda-cx-90-2024-le-satin-purple-vinyl/", "text": "Prev Previous Metallic Wrap for Mazda CX-90 2024 LE: Avery Satin Purple Transformation at Vinyl Wrap Toronto"}, "next": {"href": "/making-history-our-first-tesla-cybertruck-2024-foundation-series-wrap-in-gloss-midnight-blue/", "text": "Next Making History: Our First Tesla Cybertruck Wrap 2024 Foundation Series in Gloss Midnight Blue Next"}, "eid": "0144f5b"}]}, {"width": 25.0, "blocks": [{"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Limited Time Offer", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:22px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:500", "eid": "6026500"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Get a Stand